# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Not part of the project
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# The three reference clones: PrinceJS (the port source), SDLPoP (the behavioural
# oracle) and Mechner's Apple II source. Together about 86 MB, all of it
# reproducible from GitHub or from princeofpersia.sourceforge.net at any time.
# ARCHITECTURE.md section 2 says where each one comes from and why.
reference/

# SwiftPM build products. `swift build` regenerates all of this.
PrinceOfPersia/.build/
PrinceOfPersia/.swiftpm/
.swiftpm/

