# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deliberately NOT ignored
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
#   build/    The assembled Prince of Persia.app is committed, so the game can be
#             run by cloning and double-clicking. It is a generated artifact:
#             Scripts/make-app.sh rebuilds it in about twenty seconds, and every
#             rebuild shows up as a large diff in the binary.
#
#   *.png     Screenshots. webshot.png is the one the README shows; more are
#             welcome alongside it and in screenshots/.
#
